### Test 4 — Plan medio (dolly_plus): no permite 2 cambios de idioma seguidos
@baseUrl = http://localhost:57011/api/v1
@email = qa-test4-{{$timestamp}}@example.com
@password = QaPassword123!

### 4.1 Registro y activación de plan dolly_plus (hasta 2 idiomas)
# @name reg
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "fullName": "QA Plus Double Change"
}

@token = {{reg.response.body.data.tokens.accessToken}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/subscription
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tier": "dolly_plus"
}

### 4.2 Selección inicial de 2 idiomas -> 200 OK (fija candado anual)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/settings/languages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "languages": ["en", "it"]
}

### 4.3 Reordenar prioridad de los mismos 2 idiomas activos sí está permitido -> 200 OK
PUT {{baseUrl}}/settings/languages/reorder
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "languages": ["it", "en"]
}

### 4.4 Primer intento de cambiar idioma justo después del registro -> 403 LANGUAGE_CHANGE_LOCKED
PUT {{baseUrl}}/settings/languages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "languages": ["it", "fr"]
}

### 4.5 Desbloquear mediante pago (1 crédito) -> 1.º cambio pasa -> 2.º cambio seguido vuelve a fallar
POST {{baseUrl}}/settings/languages/unlock-change
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1.º cambio con crédito -> 200 OK (crédito vuelve a 0)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/settings/languages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "languages": ["it", "fr"]
}

### 2.º cambio seguido inmediatamente -> 403 LANGUAGE_CHANGE_LOCKED
PUT {{baseUrl}}/settings/languages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "languages": ["es", "fr"]
}
